1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,653
As Uke punches

2
00:00:01,954 --> 00:00:04,440
slide in deeply on the same foot

3
00:00:04,441 --> 00:00:07,451
with the opposite arm coming around
to deflect the punch

4
00:00:07,452 --> 00:00:09,965
as you do so step in behind deeply

5
00:00:09,966 --> 00:00:12,030
with the other arm behind the back of the neck,

6
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:13,819
turn, cut down deeply

7
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,747
as Uke gets back up draw him in
into that shoulder,

8
00:00:16,748 --> 00:00:20,932
change your feet stepping deeply behind him
and throw down.

